use zeroknowledge latest

coinname save NeedMoreCoin
difficulty save 4
target save 7237005577332262213973186563042994240829374041602535252466099000494570602496
miningreward save 10
transactionfee save 1
totalsupply save 100

alicesecret save zero knowledge secret make
aliceaddress save alicesecret zero knowledge public make
bobsecret save zero knowledge secret make
bobaddress save bobsecret zero knowledge public make
minersecret save zero knowledge secret make
mineraddress save minersecret zero knowledge public make

alicebalance save 100
bobbalance save 0
minerbalance save 0
alicenonce save 0

show coinname starts now
show Proof of work difficulty is difficulty bits

genesiscontext save coinname genesis block gives aliceaddress 100 coins
genesismining save true
genesistries save 0
genesiscommitment save 0
genesishash save 0
while genesismining
genesisnonce save zero knowledge nonce make
genesiscandidatecommitment save genesisnonce zero knowledge commitment make
genesishashcandidate save mineraddress genesiscandidatecommitment genesiscontext zero knowledge challenge make
genesistries add 1
if genesishashcandidate is less than target
genesiscommitment save genesiscandidatecommitment
genesishash save genesishashcandidate
genesismining save false
end
end

show Genesis block mined
show Genesis work attempts genesistries

transactionamount save 25
transactionnonce save 1
expectednonce save alicenonce
expectednonce add 1
neededbalance save transactionamount
neededbalance add transactionfee
transactioncontext save aliceaddress sends transactionamount coins to bobaddress fee transactionfee nonce transactionnonce
transactionproof save alicesecret transactioncontext zero knowledge proof make
signaturevalid save aliceaddress transactionproof transactioncontext zero knowledge verify
transactionaccepted save false
if signaturevalid
if transactionamount is greater than 0
if alicebalance is greater than or equal to neededbalance
if transactionnonce equals expectednonce
transactionaccepted save true
end
end
end
end

if transactionaccepted
subtract transactionamount from alicebalance
subtract transactionfee from alicebalance
add transactionamount to bobbalance
alicenonce save transactionnonce
end

blockcontext save coinname block one previous genesishash transaction transactioncontext proof transactionproof miner mineraddress reward miningreward
blockmining save transactionaccepted
blocktries save 0
blockcommitment save 0
blockhash save 0
while blockmining
blocknonce save zero knowledge nonce make
blockcandidatecommitment save blocknonce zero knowledge commitment make
blockhashcandidate save mineraddress blockcandidatecommitment blockcontext zero knowledge challenge make
blocktries add 1
if blockhashcandidate is less than target
blockcommitment save blockcandidatecommitment
blockhash save blockhashcandidate
blockmining save false
end
end

if transactionaccepted
add miningreward to minerbalance
add transactionfee to minerbalance
add miningreward to totalsupply
end

show Block one mined
show Block one work attempts blocktries

checktransactioncontext save aliceaddress sends transactionamount coins to bobaddress fee transactionfee nonce transactionnonce
checksignature save aliceaddress transactionproof checktransactioncontext zero knowledge verify
checkgenesiscontext save coinname genesis block gives aliceaddress 100 coins
checkgenesishash save mineraddress genesiscommitment checkgenesiscontext zero knowledge challenge make
checkblockcontext save coinname block one previous genesishash transaction checktransactioncontext proof transactionproof miner mineraddress reward miningreward
checkblockhash save mineraddress blockcommitment checkblockcontext zero knowledge challenge make
balancesum save alicebalance
balancesum add bobbalance
balancesum add minerbalance

chainvalid save false
if checksignature
if checkgenesishash equals genesishash
if checkgenesishash is less than target
if checkblockhash equals blockhash
if checkblockhash is less than target
if balancesum equals totalsupply
chainvalid save true
end
end
end
end
end
end

if chainvalid
show Full blockchain verification succeeded
end

tamperedamount save 250
tamperedcontext save aliceaddress sends tamperedamount coins to bobaddress fee transactionfee nonce transactionnonce
tamperedsignaturevalid save aliceaddress transactionproof tamperedcontext zero knowledge verify
tamperedblockcontext save coinname block one previous genesishash transaction tamperedcontext proof transactionproof miner mineraddress reward miningreward
tamperedblockhash save mineraddress blockcommitment tamperedblockcontext zero knowledge challenge make
if tamperedsignaturevalid equals false
show Signature rejected the changed transaction amount
end
if tamperedblockhash is not equal to blockhash
show Block hash rejected the changed transaction amount
end

replayexpectednonce save alicenonce
replayexpectednonce add 1
if transactionnonce is not equal to replayexpectednonce
show Transaction nonce rejected replay of the old transaction
end

show Alice final balance alicebalance
show Bob final balance bobbalance
show Miner final balance minerbalance
show Total supply totalsupply
if balancesum equals totalsupply
show Monetary supply conservation verified
end
